{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"readonly","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSArray<MLNPolygon *>","preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSArray"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"interiorPolygons"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The area occupied by any interior polygons is excluded from the overall shape.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Interior polygons should not overlap. An interior polygon should not have","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"interior polygons of its own."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If there are no interior polygons, the value of this property is ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","title":"interiorPolygons","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNPolygon(py)interiorPolygons","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"interiorPolygons"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"interiorPolygons"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The array of polygons nested inside the receiver."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnpolygon\/interiorpolygons"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyPr